    {
      "id": "claim_8e596f1f001747dd992f5bfd289fbbf7",
      "statement": "Item writes carry a search-index side effect owned by the handlers: create and update call services::search_index::sync_item and propagate its error as a 500 even after the row was written, while delete removes the items_fts row with a direct DELETE; no tag, container, or category rename resyncs affected items.",
