      "id": "claim_b823dbd555824bdbaa46f50d5ab080c2",
      "statement": "Create-time defaults live in the repositories rather than the DTOs: CreateItem without source_type is stored as \"handmade\" and CreateContainer without container_type is stored as \"other\", while all other optional create fields persist as NULL.",
