    {
      "id": "claim_f6ae262635e94c73a41933cd55c98a75",
      "statement": "Tree responses are shaped by #[serde(flatten)]: CategoryNode and ContainerNode serialize the inner row's fields at the top level with an appended children array, so there is no node wrapper key for clients to unwrap.",
