      "id": "claim_dc096ed1550f40d6896a4fca78c7d99c",
      "statement": "There are no automated tests covering the HTTP surface: server/tests/ holds no test files, so `just test` (cargo test -p server) does not verify routes, DTOs, or the error envelope, leaving manual curl checks as the practical verification.",
